Compact SwayOSD popups (against SwayOSD 0.3.2, src/server/osd_window.rs):
  - microphone: a square with the mic / mic-off icon, no bar
  - speaker muted: the same square with a slashed speaker (volume changes keep the capsule)
  - Caps Lock: the same square with the caps-lock icon
Styled by the .microphone / .keylock classes in config/swayosd/style.css.
Built and installed by scripts/build-swayosd.sh (./install.sh --with-osd-patch).

